      "number": "H.1",
      "page": 5,
      "title": "Review, Discuss, and provide Feedback on the Long-Range Calendar, Discussion, and possible Feedback. The following matters were reviewed during the Long-Range Calendar discussion: Chair Tonking stated that the April 2, 2025, meeting will be canceled, and a Special Meeting will be held on Monday, (Stated May) updated to April 14th. Director Herron provided an overview of the changes made to the Long-Range Calendar and stated that the GM Goals have been added to the calendar. Additional information on the beach barbecues (an item the Trustees would like to bring back). There are 24 barbecues between the two beaches. There is some funding in the beach budget to take care of some of them this year, and staff are working on the funding for all of them"
